    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10645" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιφερίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set oneself against, measure oneself with,</i>
			
